  <reporting-org ref="GB-CHC-285776" type="21">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Value Chain Analysis and Participatory Market System Development of Groundnuts Production in Gogrial</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will complement the ongoing projects being implemented by the Local Partner TOCH by meeting the funding gaps identified during the annual project review meeting and additional needs identified during project implementation.  Through this funding request, CTP proposes to engage a consultant who will conduct a thorough value chain analysis of groundnuts. This will also include market chain analysis of groundnut production in Gogiral East. The findings and recommendations of the analysis shall provide guidance to CTP to engage a Facilitator who will training our Local Partner (ToT ) on participatory market systems development in ground nut production. Cascade trainings shall be provided to Farmer Groups and Village Savings and Loan Association (VSLA). The training will also include mentoring the groups in understanding the key market actors in the ground nuts value chain.</narrative>
  </description>
